    "background_story": "Alia was a brilliant and reclusive scholar of ancient mysticism. Her fascination with the obscure and the unknown led her to spend years pouring over dusty tomes and crumbling manuscripts. Her colleagues often found her theories and writings to be abstruse, veiled in a language that only she could decipher. But Alia was undeterred, convinced that the secrets she uncovered held the key to unlocking the mysteries of the universe. As she delved deeper into her research, her ideas became increasingly esoteric, sparking both awe and skepticism among her peers. Despite the criticism, Alia remained devoted to her pursuit of knowledge, driven by a passion for the obscure and the unknown. Her groundbreaking work would eventually earn her recognition as a leading expert in her field, though her abstruse writings would remain a subject of debate and intrigue.",
